#: web-components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"and using\n"
"framework-agnostic custom elements from\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` classes),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors out of the\n"
"  box), and `@pantoken/web-components` (auto-registers elements like "
"`<instui-icon>`), then\n"
"  renders markup into `#app`.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — replace their contents with your own markup.\n"
"- Use custom elements directly in markup, e.g. `<instui-button>`, `<instui-"
"alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  see the [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  for the full element list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"En simpel TypeScript-app (via Vite) stylet med\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"og bruger\n"
"framework-uafhængige brugerdefinerede elementer fra\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Udvikling\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Hvad er her\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` importerer `@pantoken/css` (definerer hver `--instui-*` "
"brugerdefineret egenskab),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*`-klasser),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (sætter modal-, tooltip- og anden komponentadfærd "
"op som standard), og `@pantoken/web-components` (auto-registrerer elementer "
"som `<instui-icon>`), derefter\n"
"  gengiver markup til `#app`.\n"
"- Valgfrie indsætningspunkter (header, filtre, indhold, efterfølgende) er "
"markeret med\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — erstat deres indhold med dit eget markup.\n"
"- Brug brugerdefinerede elementer direkte i markup, f.eks. `<instui-"
"button>`, `<instui-alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  se [`@pantoken/web-components`-README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  for den fulde elementliste.\n"
"\n"
"## Lær mere\n"
"\n"
"Se [HTML-guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) for at lære mere.\n"
